@startuml
actor Reporter
participant Frontend
participant API
participant ImageValidator
participant Storage
participant SarvamService
participant Sarvam
database Database

Reporter -> Frontend: Enter report details and upload image
Frontend -> API: POST /reports (multipart)
API -> ImageValidator: Validate type, size, dimensions
ImageValidator --> API: Prepared image
API -> Storage: Store original and thumbnail
Storage --> API: Storage references
API -> Database: Create Draft report
API -> SarvamService: generateItemDescription(image)
SarvamService -> Sarvam: Send base64 data URI and prompt
Sarvam --> SarvamService: Structured JSON or error
SarvamService --> API: Validated draft or failure
API -> Database: Store AI metadata/status
API --> Frontend: Editable AI draft
Reporter -> Frontend: Review and edit description
Frontend -> API: Submit approved report
API -> Database: Set status Active and index report
API --> Reporter: Report confirmation
@enduml
